{"study_accession":"PRJNA1332360","secondary_study_accession":"SRP623998","title":"RNF31 involves in alpha defensin induced NFKB activation in macrophages","description":"alpha defensins are produced by human neutrophils and then sequestered in the azurophilic granule of neutrophils. Upon neutrophil activation or degranulation, alpha defensins are released into the alveolar milieu, increasing the concentration of extracellular alpha defensins in the lung. The goal of this study is to examine whether alpha defensins activate inflammatory signaling pathways in macrophages and identify the key molecules involved. To conduct this study, Leukopaks were purchased from LifeSouth Community Blood Center. We isolated monocytes from Leukopaks and differentiated monocyte macrophages.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":15,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN51731699","study_accession":"PRJNA1332360","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","description":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","sex":"not collected","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-10-03","attributes":[["isolate","not applicable_S1C"],["age","not collected"],["biomaterial_provider","Alpha -1 Research Program at the University of Florida"],["collection_date","not collected"],["geo_loc_name","USA: Gainesville"],["sex","not collected"],["tissue","Blood"],["cell_type","Monocyte-derived macrophage"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR35538369","experiment_accession":"SRX30613645","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA_oligo_dT","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":0,"base_count":0,"first_public":"2026-10-03","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: bulk RNA-seq of Monocyte-derived macrophage"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN51731700","study_accession":"PRJNA1332360","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Hom